cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper below and this repository.
title: "PolyCard: A Learned Cardinality Estimator for Intersection Queries on Spatial Polygons"
abstract: >-
  PolyCard is a learned cardinality estimator for intersection queries on
  spatial polygons. It transforms variable-sized polygons into fixed-sized
  vectors by zone-aware adaptive sampling and trains an MLP stack with a
  q-error loss on generated training queries whose cardinalities are evenly
  distributed.
